    <string name="static_found_by_reading_every_script_a_fi">Found by reading every script: a fixed battle, a gift or an egg. When a script puts the species in a variable first (Ho-Oh and Lugia, Latias and Latios, the Game Corner prizes, the starters), each number it can use is listed, and a change edits that number; a level that a script puts in a variable first (Ho-Oh and Lugia, one for each game version) is listed the same way (the game picks one by its version: HeartGold uses 45 for Ho-Oh and 70 for Lugia, SoulSilver the other way round). A species or a level that no script sets with a number are listed but not edited here: change the script in the Scripts editor. Roaming Pokémon are in the Roamers editor and the revived fossils in the Fossils editor; neither is a script command with a species, so they are not listed here.</string>
